# Outfit head (R18): a soft hood up over the voxel head: rounded crown, a peak over the brow, a wide open face, the
# cloth draped down the back of the neck, accent rim around the opening.
# Head frame: the head fills x 1..6, y 2..6, z 2..7 (pivot 3 4 2).
name outfit_hood
grid 5
size 8 8 10
slot hood SwatchMain
slot rim SwatchAccent
ellipsoid 3.1 4 5.2 3.9 3.9 4.4 hood
box 0 1 0 3 7 3 hood
carve box 1 2 2 6 6 7
carve box 5 2 1 8 6 7
box 5 3 7 7 5 8 hood
paint box 5 0 0 8 8 10 rim
pivot 3 4 2
